  "description": "Build serializable query specifications — filters, sorts, projections — as plain data, then apply them anywhere. QuerySpec.Core ships the cross-cutting concerns most data-access layers reinvent: auditing with integrity hashing, data masking and row-level security, in-memory and distributed caching, resilience (retry, circuit breaker, rate limiting, bulkhead), and System.Diagnostics.Metrics observability. Trim- and AOT-ready. Multi-targets .NET 8 (LTS), .NET 9, and .NET 10 (LTS). Pair with QuerySpec.EFCore to translate specifications to LINQ against Entity Framework Core.",
